From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:57:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] http2: capture every stream on a multiplexed connection

Fixes OBI dropping all but one HTTP/2 stream per multiplexed connection, plus a
unit test and an h2mux integration test (docker-compose fixture).

Source: aed1c1c8, e74ebb5e.
Adot-Obi-Patch: 02-http2-multiplex
